---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Research | Shubham Gade" description="Research in precision irrigation, remote sensing, crop phenotyping, digital agriculture and climate-smart agriculture.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Research</div><h1>From crop measurement to management decisions.</h1><p class="lead">My research combines field and greenhouse experimentation with precision irrigation, remote sensing, crop phenotyping, geospatial analysis and data-driven methods.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section compact"><div class="container">
    <article class="research-theme" id="water"><div class="theme-index">01 · WATER</div><div class="theme-content"><h2>Precision Irrigation & Crop Water Management</h2><p>I investigate how irrigation strategies can improve crop productivity, water-use efficiency and physiological performance under resource-limited conditions. Current work examines interactions among irrigation regimes, biochar application and crop responses in controlled-environment bell pepper production.</p><div class="theme-tags"><span>Precision Irrigation</span><span>Deficit Irrigation</span><span>Water-Use Efficiency</span><span>Crop Water Stress</span><span>Biochar</span></div></div></article>
    <article class="research-theme" id="sensing"><div class="theme-index">02 · SENSING</div><div class="theme-content"><h2>Remote Sensing & Crop Phenotyping</h2><p>I use proximal and UAV-based imaging to quantify crop responses that are difficult to capture through conventional measurements alone. Current work integrates RGB, thermal and multispectral imagery for monitoring crop water and nutrient status, estimating crop stress and developing image-based indicators for precision management.</p><div class="theme-tags"><span>RGB Imaging</span><span>Thermal Imaging</span><span>Multispectral</span><span>UAV</span><span>CWSI</span></div></div></article>
    <article class="research-theme" id="digital"><div class="theme-index">03 · DIGITAL</div><div class="theme-content"><h2>AI, Computer Vision & Geospatial Analytics</h2><p>My work includes satellite imagery, Google Earth Engine, GIS platforms and deep-learning approaches for extracting agricultural information from spatial and image datasets, including soil and nutrient mapping, aquaculture detection and agricultural water-resource identification.</p><div class="theme-tags"><span>Google Earth Engine</span><span>GIS</span><span>Python</span><span>Machine Learning</span><span>Computer Vision</span></div></div></article>
    <article class="research-theme" id="climate"><div class="theme-index">04 · CLIMATE</div><div class="theme-content"><h2>Climate-Smart Agriculture & Digital Advisory</h2><p>I am interested in the use of climate information, digital tools and agricultural advisory systems to support climate-resilient decision-making, including collaborative work on agrometeorological forecasts and farmer-oriented information services in Thailand and Vietnam.</p><div class="theme-tags"><span>Climate Services</span><span>Agrometeorology</span><span>Digital Advisory</span><span>Decision Support</span><span>Southeast Asia</span></div></div></article>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section" id="doctoral"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Doctoral Research</div><h2>Enhancing productivity through precision agriculture.</h2><p class="lead" style="margin-top:18px">Integrating water, soil amendments, nutrient management and crop sensing for precision bell pepper production.</p><div class="doctoral-grid">
    <div class="doctoral-card"><div class="n">COMPONENT 01</div><h3>Irrigation × Biochar</h3><p>Growth, physiology, yield and water-use efficiency under contrasting irrigation and biochar treatments.</p></div>
    <div class="doctoral-card"><div class="n">COMPONENT 02</div><h3>Water Stress × RGB/Thermal</h3><p>Image-based crop water-status monitoring and crop water stress index estimation.</p></div>
    <div class="doctoral-card"><div class="n">COMPONENT 03</div><h3>Nitrogen × Biochar</h3><p>Yield, crop quality and nitrogen-use efficiency under different nutrient-management scenarios.</p></div>
    <div class="doctoral-card"><div class="n">COMPONENT 04</div><h3>Multispectral × Machine Learning</h3><p>Prediction of leaf nitrogen concentration and crop nutrient status using image-derived information.</p></div>
  </div></div></section>

  <section class="section compact"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Research Workflow</div><h2>From observation to decision support.</h2><div class="process-grid">
    <div class="process-card"><span>01</span><h3>Observe</h3><p>Field, greenhouse, plant, sensor and image measurements.</p></div>
    <div class="process-card"><span>02</span><h3>Analyze</h3><p>Remote sensing, GIS, image processing and machine learning.</p></div>
    <div class="process-card"><span>03</span><h3>Understand</h3><p>Crop water, nutrient, physiological and stress responses.</p></div>
    <div class="process-card"><span>04</span><h3>Support Decisions</h3><p>Translate evidence into resource-efficient crop-management approaches.</p></div>
  </div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
